§§ `s 21 reasons from the decision-maker`

-- decision 1 March 2026, no s 20 notice: 28 days after is Sunday 29 March 2026, so the last day is Monday 30 March
-- (Interpretation Act 1984 (WA) s 61(1)(e), F12).
#ASSERT `By when can I ask for reasons` FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 3 2026) FALSE FALSE `no date` EQUALS `the last day is` (`d` 30 3 2026)
-- s 20 applies, notice given 10 March 2026: the later of 30 March and 7 April.
#ASSERT `By when can I ask for reasons` FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 3 2026) TRUE TRUE (`d` 10 3 2026) EQUALS `the last day is` (`d` 7 4 2026)
-- notice given on the decision day: both end Monday 30 March
