#ASSERT `Can I still ask for reasons on this day` FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 3 2026) TRUE FALSE `no date` (`d` 1 9 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Can I still ask for reasons on this day` TRUE FALSE (`d` 1 3 2026) FALSE FALSE `no date` (`d` 2 3 2026) EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Can I still ask for reasons on this day` FALSE FALSE (`d` 1 3 2026) FALSE FALSE `no date` (`d` 28 2 2026) EQUALS NOTHING
